    "detailed_description": "Arcade Reflex takes the essence of classic arcade games and gives it a modern twist. You control a paddle, navigating through fast-paced levels where the gameplay keeps evolving. It starts off simple, but the challenges quickly ramp up, so you\u2019ll need sharp reflexes. The minimalist design nods to retro games, but there\u2019s more depth here than meets the eye. Perfect for quick sessions, Arcade Reflex offers a fresh take on the arcade formula. Ready to see how far you can climb on the leaderboards?",
